  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Habitat for Humanity: Ukrainian Refugee Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Right now, Habitat is addressing the immediate and mid-term shelter needs of Ukrainian civilians seeking refuge in Hungary, Poland, Romania, and Slovakia, with special attention to vulnerable individuals, such as single mothers, the elderly, people with disabilities or chronic illnesses, and nationals of third-party countries residing in Ukraine when the conflict began. As the situation within Ukraine continues to unfold, we remain flexible in our approach in neighboring countries.</narrative>
  </description>
